<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith's Food EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith's Food EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Gary Giblen reduced his earnings estimate for Smith's Food &amp; Drug Centers Inc to $0.27 a share from $0.30 for the fourth quarter, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- The Wall Street consensus is $0.36 a share.</p>
<p>-- Giblem also cut his 1997 estimate to $1.35 a share from $1.50, according to a Smith Barney source. The consensus is $1.54.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-1/2 to 29.</p>
</text>
